---
title: Chocolate Fudge Frosting
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Frostings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@sugar{1%c}
@baking chocolate{1%square}
@vanilla{1%tsp}
@shortening{1/3%c}
@milk{1/4%c}

Bring to a boil and cook 2 minutes, stirring constantly.
Remove from heat and place in cold water. Beat until consistency to spread. Enough for 8x8 cake.
